     2	
     3	Training fine-tunes the embedding table and a hidden-layer classifier. This is
     4	a different tool chain and architecture from frozen embeddings with sklearn.
     5	Evaluation receives the same selected train rows and complete test rows as the
     6	frozen-POTION comparisons. No evaluation row enters training or early stopping.
