   201	    the commit already (a read-only cache), else a temporary file renamed over it, so a
   202	    reader never sees half a ref. A link or other kind of entry on the way raises, as for
   203	    the reader; two writers leave the commit of the later rename."""
   204	    parts = ["refs", *revision.split("/")]
