    11	with ``"model_type": "fse"`` names the file of an fse encoder; a Model2Vec model has
    12	``config.json``, ``model.safetensors`` and ``tokenizer.json`` (as model2vec finds it, with
    13	any or no model_type of model2vec); otherwise a ``modules.json`` makes it a
    14	sentence-transformers model (``fse._encoder._sentence_transformers``); anything else is no
    15	static embedding model and raises, naming what it is. The files come through ``Files``
    16	(``fse._encoder._files``), each read once into bytes that are checked and then parsed: a
    17	folder, whose links are followed only into the blobs of a Hugging Face cache, or a Hub
